# i18n Workflow

The project has locale files in `public/locales/en/translation.json` and `public/locales/ru/translation.json`.

## When changing user-facing text

- Prefer translation keys over hardcoded strings in components.
- Keep keys and structure consistent between `en` and `ru`.

## Required follow-up after locale updates

- Regenerate i18n resources types with `pnpm i18n:resources`.
- Ensure TypeScript stays clean after key changes (`pnpm lint:typescript`).

## Avoid

- Introducing text only in one language without intentional fallback.
- Editing generated i18n type files manually when a generator exists.
